{"4118790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Christmas Fables: Nutcracker's Tale Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 4118790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4162680], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/aae61403440111069167b462a8274574.avif?t=1766573078\" width=600 height=230 /></span>Step into the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventures — a genre that combines storytelling, exploration, and puzzle-solving. Players immerse themselves in beautifully illustrated scenes, searching for cleverly hidden items and solving a variety of logic-based puzzles and mini-games. It’s a perfect blend of mystery, relaxation, and discovery — every click moves the story forward and brings the magic to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.poster.avif?t=1766573078\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.webm?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.mp4?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas Eve, young Alex places his cherished Nutcracker beneath the glittering tree, wishing for a true friend. When midnight strikes, his world transforms — toys awaken, kingdoms gleam under snowfall, and danger lurks in the shadows. Alex’s Nutcracker becomes Prince Henry, who fights to protect his realm from the sinister Wormtooth and his army of metal rats. To save both worlds, Alex and Henry must reach the Sugar Plum Fairy’s castle and restore the broken Christmas Star before darkness consumes the magic of Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/c9e8ab2639ce797262f6c79d62f49dcc.poster.avif?t=1766573078\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/c9e8ab2639ce797262f6c79d62f49dcc.webm?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/c9e8ab2639ce797262f6c79d62f49dcc.mp4?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an enchanting mix of challenges: from classic hidden object scenes to creative mini-games that test your attention and wit. Each puzzle brings you closer to the heart of the story and the spirit of Christmas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Embark on a dazzling holiday adventure where wishes can change reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Explore snowy kingdoms, glittering castles, and enchanted skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Solve dozens of magical puzzles and clever mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Search for hidden objects and discover collectible treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Restore the shattered Christmas Star to open the gateway between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Earn achievements as Alex and Henry uncover the true meaning of friendship and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1766573078\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.webm?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.mp4?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find magic, mystery, and warmth in a holiday journey that will rekindle your sense of wonder and make you believe in Christmas miracles once more.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/aae61403440111069167b462a8274574.avif?t=1766573078\" width=600 height=230 /></span>Step into the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventures — a genre that combines storytelling, exploration, and puzzle-solving. Players immerse themselves in beautifully illustrated scenes, searching for cleverly hidden items and solving a variety of logic-based puzzles and mini-games. It’s a perfect blend of mystery, relaxation, and discovery — every click moves the story forward and brings the magic to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.poster.avif?t=1766573078\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.webm?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/669a1dec646e277c9dc01bfa621d4cca.mp4?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/mp4\"