hidden objects and discover collectible treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Restore the shattered Christmas Star to open the gateway between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 Earn achievements as Alex and Henry uncover the true meaning of friendship and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1766573078\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.webm?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.mp4?t=1766573078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find magic, mystery, and warmth in a holiday journey that will rekindle your sense of wonder and make you believe in Christmas miracles once more.</p>", "short_description": "Join Alex and the Nutcracker on a magical Christmas quest! Solve puzzles, find hidden objects, and save both worlds from darkness.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/376d6645cb74b82d0292d32a5596ab725225a53b/header.jpg?t=1766573078", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/1a5c8e251d1e51d9d4bdaf7b76109bb29f83126c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766573078", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/1a5c8e251d1e51d9d4bdaf7b76109bb29f83126c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17